    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PPTB 42:\u00a0 A Rogue-Lite Strategy Resource Management Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will harvest four distinct resource types using Pipetubes, and use these resources to obtain progressively advanced Pipetubes, building increasingly complex pipelines to overcome escalating resource challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Puzzle-Solving</strong><br>Players will deal with procedrually generated event puzzles, to trigger different storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Element</strong> <br>Players will explore a procedurally generated world, with randomized Pipetube Cards and special efffect Stickers to create a unique experience for every new round of game.</p>",
